20 guys out there

999
01:02:38.600 --> 01:02:41.067
that would love
to see Nick dead.

1000
01:02:41.100 --> 01:02:43.333
So you wanna tell me
what happened?

1001
01:02:44.500 --> 01:02:47.033
[Nick groaning]

1002
01:02:50.100 --> 01:02:52.033
[Chuckles]

1003
01:02:53.467 --> 01:02:55.200
Oh. you don't
have it in you.

1004
01:02:56.700 --> 01:02:58.233
[Yells]

1005
01:02:58.267 --> 01:02:59.267
[Footsteps]

1006
01:02:59.300 --> 01:03:00.267
[Gasps]

1007
01:03:02.333 --> 01:03:03.300
[Yells]

1008
01:03:07.067 --> 01:03:09.133
I... no.

1009
01:03:10.300 --> 01:03:12.700
Okay.

1010
01:03:18.300 --> 01:03:21.100
[Chattering]

1011
01:03:36.233 --> 01:03:38.067
Hi. grace.

1012
01:03:39.433 --> 01:03:41.100
How you feeling?

1013
01:03:41.133 --> 01:03:43.133
Hi. Mrs. aveson.

1014
01:03:43.167 --> 01:03:45.267
Uh. great.

1015
01:03:45.300 --> 01:03:46.667
They're gonna operate
in the morning.

1016
01:03:48.100 --> 01:03:50.167
Where's your mom?

1017
01:03:50.200 --> 01:03:52.467
She's on her way.

1018
01:03:52.500 --> 01:03:54.067
She had to work
up in Oakland today.

1019
01:03:58.300 --> 01:04:00.800
Those are pretty.
Where'd you get them?

1020
01:04:00.833 --> 01:04:03.133
Uh. my dining room table.

1021
01:04:03.167 --> 01:04:06.567
Sorry. I didn't have time
to go to the florist.

1022
01:04:06.600 --> 01:04:10.033
But strawberry.
banana. pineapple.

1023
01:04:10.067 --> 01:04:12.133
with protein powder
and a vitamin dose.

1024
01:04:12.167 --> 01:04:14.800
Wow. How'd you know
this was my favorite?

1025
01:04:14.833 --> 01:04:18.200
'Cause you and Cassie
always get the same thing.

1026
01:04:18.233 --> 01:04:19.567
You have for years.

1027
01:04:22.833 --> 01:04:24.767
Where is she?

1028
01:04:31.100 --> 01:04:33.033
The f.B.I. Knows
you were involved.

1029
01:04:34.667 --> 01:04:37.533
What I don't get...
Why would someone like you.

1030
01:04:37.567 --> 01:04:40.233
about to go to one of
the top universities
in the country.

1031
01:04:40.267 --> 01:04:42.700
want to rob a bank?

1032
01:04:42.733 --> 01:04:45.467
Do you need money
for tuition?

1033
01:04:51.133 --> 01:04:55.133
Grace. please.

1034
01:04:55.167 --> 01:04:57.700
tell me what's going on.

1035
01:05:04.800 --> 01:05:07.100
As I was driving here.
I was thinking

1036
01:05:07.133 --> 01:05:10.633
I should prepare some
really clever argument

1037
01:05:10.667 --> 01:05:14.200
to convince you to talk.

1038
01:05:14.233 --> 01:05:16.700
but I couldn't come up
with anything.

1039
01:05:18.467 --> 01:05:21.633
All I know is. uh...

1040
01:05:21.667 --> 01:05:24.267
My husband's gone now.

1041
01:05:27.167 --> 01:05:30.067
Cassie's my whole life.

1042
01:05:31.267 --> 01:05:33.433
I make her breakfast. um...

1043
01:05:33.467 --> 01:05:35.267
I. uh...

1044
01:05:35.300 --> 01:05:38.333
On mondays.
I wash her clothes.

1045
01:05:38.367 --> 01:05:41.067
I pay her car insurance
when she forgets.

1046
01:05:41.100 --> 01:05:42.767
[Crying softly]

1047
01:05:42.800 --> 01:05:45.333
I want to. uh.

1048
01:05:45.367 --> 01:05:49.133
help pick out her classes
for college. and. uh...

1049
01:05:49.167 --> 01:05:50.533
I really hope
she goes to college.

1050
01:05:52.467 --> 01:05:55.367
I wanna see her find
a career she really loves.

1051
01:05:55.400 --> 01:05:57.133
and. uh...

1052
01:05:59.200 --> 01:06:01.067
Grace. I really wanna
see her get married.

1053
01:06:03.300 --> 01:06:05.467
This morning.

1054
01:06:05.500 --> 01:06:09.533
someone in a mask
put a gun to her head.

1055
01:06:09.567 --> 01:06:12.133
and I couldn't
do anything.

1056
01:06:12.167 --> 01:06:14.567
I'm her mother.

1057
01:06:14.600 --> 01:06:16.767
and my job
is to protect her.

1058
01:06:16.800 --> 01:06:19.000
and I couldn't
do anything.

1059
01:06:20.533 --> 01:06:23.067
Is that the last time
I'm going to see her?

1060
01:06:24.667 --> 01:06:27.100
Oh. grace. please.
I don't know where she is.

1061
01:06:27.133 --> 01:06:29.367
I don't know
if she's been taken from me.

1062
01:06:29.400 --> 01:06:31.733
or if she's just
running away from me

1063
01:06:31.767 --> 01:06:33.400
or what is going on.

1064
01:06:33.433 --> 01:06:35.667
So please. please!

1065
01:06:37.800 --> 01:06:40.600
Please. grace.
just tell me what's going on.

1066
01:06:42.767 --> 01:06:45.400
I love her so much.

1067
01:06:48.067 --> 01:06:50.767
And I love you and abbie.
I always have.

1068
01:06:50.800 --> 01:06:53.400
ever since you were little
and I coached you in soccer.

1069
01:06:53.433 --> 01:06:56.267
Remember that?

1070
01:06:56.300 --> 01:06:59.233
We never won one game.
but we had a lot of fun. right?

1071
01:07:00.333 --> 01:07:02.300
Please.

1072
01:07:07.767 --> 01:07:09.767
I am so sorry
about all this.

1073
01:07:12.300 --> 01:07:14.667
I... I can't say anything.

1074
01:07:14.700 --> 01:07:17.033
but if it's any help.

1075
01:07:17.067 --> 01:07:19.433
just know this whole thing
will be over in 45 minutes.

1076
01:07:24.433 --> 01:07:27.500
That's 4:00.

1077
01:07:27.533 --> 01:07:30.267
What's happening
at 4:00?

1078
01:07:37.100 --> 01:07:41.500
Coyote pass.
off of highway 98.

1079
01:07:41.533 --> 01:07:44.467
They're going to the desert.
Grace. why?

1080
01:07:46.300 --> 01:07:47.633
Why are they going there?

1081
01:07:47.667 --> 01:07:49.600
I can't say.

1082
01:07:58.633 --> 01:08:00.633
[Panting]

1083
01:08:47.367 --> 01:08:49.667
[Abbie's father]
Abbie. what did you do?

1084
01:08:49.700 --> 01:08:52.267
4:00. Don't be late.
or I chop off his head.

1085
01:09:16.200 --> 01:09:18.700
There it is.
Right up there.

1086
01:09:30.467 --> 01:09:33.233
[Sighs]

1087
01:12:04.467 --> 01:12:06.600
Okay. It's gotta be
down there.

1088
01:12:35.067 --> 01:12:37.300
Cassie!
[Echoing]
[Gasps]

1089
01:12:37.333 --> 01:12:39.000
Mom?

1090
01:12:45.533 --> 01:12:47.367
Oh. my God!
Are you okay?

1091
01:12:49.600 --> 01:12:52.533
How did you find us?
It wasn't easy.

1092
01:12:52.567 --> 01:12:55.100
What are you doing here?
I want the truth.
You need to leave.

1093
01:12:55.133 --> 01:12:57.433
Why?
What is going on?

1094
01:12:57.467 --> 01:12:59.500
They can't see you.
They'll think it's a trap.

1095
01:13:01.200 --> 01:13:04.800
She's right. mom.
"They"? Who's they?

1096
01:13:04.833 --> 01:13:08.633
[Stammers]
Girls. I am not budging.
so you better just spit it out.

1097
01:13:08.667 --> 01:13:10.400
What is going on?

1098
01:13:13.367 --> 01:13:17.033
All right. Abbie's dad
was kidnapped in Tijuana.

1099
01:13:17.067 --> 01:13:19.600
and the kidnappers
are gonna be here any minute.

1100
01:13:19.633 --> 01:13:23.067
What?
They told me that
I had to give them

1101
01:13:23.100 --> 01:13:25.533
a half a million dollars
or they would kill him.

1102
01:13:25.567 --> 01:13:29.167
That's why I robbed the bank.
She's telling the truth. mom.

1103
01:13:29.200 --> 01:13:32.700
Did you help her?
No. I had no idea she was
doing any of this until today.

1104
01:13:32.733 --> 01:13:35.700
Please. don't hate me.
Ms. aveson.

1105
01:13:35.733 --> 01:13:39.167
My mom is gone.
and my dad is broke.

1106
01:13:39.200 --> 01:13:42.267
I couldn't tell the cops.
What else could I do?

1107
01:13:42.300 --> 01:13:44.433
What would you do?

1108
01:13:44.467 --> 01:13:47.633
[Cassie]
Mom. you really
have to leave right now.

1109
01:13:47.667 --> 01:13:49.600
This is mendoza.
Code 10-31.

1110
01:13:49.633 --> 01:13:53.267
I'm at the end
of coyote pass trail
off highway 98.

1111
01:13:53.300 --> 01:13:56.300
I'm gonna need backup.
Code 10-31.

1112
01:13:56.333 --> 01:13:59.533
[Abbie]
Please. Mrs. aveson.
my dad's life depends on it.

1113
01:13:59.567 --> 01:14:02.267
We need to get outta here now.
We'll call the police.
They'll handle it. Come on.

1114
01:14:02.300 --> 01:14:04.300
No. I'm not leaving
without my dad!

1115
01:14:04.333 --> 01:14:06.500
You and Cassie should just go
and get outta here.

1116
01:14:06.533 --> 01:14:08.133
No. we all go together.

1117
01:14:08.167 --> 01:14:10.100
No. I'm staying.

1118
01:14:10.133 --> 01:14:12.400
You're always bugging me to have
some kind of ambition. right?

1119
01:14:12.433 --> 01:14:15.300
To believe in something.
Well. abbie is my best friend.
Oh. jeez.

1120
01:14:15.333 --> 01:14:18.367
If I walk out on her
at a time like this.
what kind of a woman am I?

1121
01:14:18.400 --> 01:14:20.467
You are gonna be
a dead woman.

1122
01:14:20.500 --> 01:14:23.400
and none of
that idealistic garbage
that I taught you

1123
01:14:23.433 --> 01:14:25.367
will mean anything.
do you hear me?

1124
01:14:25.400 --> 01:14:27.400
Let's go. both of you!
[Vehicle approaching]

1125
01:15:08.400 --> 01:15:09.367
[spanish]

1126
01:15:29.333 --> 01:15:31.233
Who are you?

1127
01:15:32.567 --> 01:15:34.433
This is my friend
and her mom.

1128
01:15:34.467 --> 01:15:37.367
I told you
to come alone.
You a cop?

1129
01:15:37.400 --> 01:15:39.700
No. I'm just here
to help abbie.

1130
01:15:41.433 --> 01:15:43.133
Chaperones.

1131
01:15:43.167 --> 01:15:44.467
Pretty ones.

1132
01:15:47.700 --> 01:15:49.167
You got the money?

1133
01:15:55.333 --> 01:15:57.633
Hey.

1134
01:15:57.667 --> 01:15:59.100
[Chuckles]

1135
01:16:21.567 --> 01:16:23.500
It looks like
a million to me.

1136
01:16:25.100 --> 01:16:28.133
Senorita Duncan.

1137
01:16:28.167 --> 01:16:30.267
it was a pleasure
doing business with you.

1138
01:16:30.300 --> 01:16:33.267
Maybe we do it again
sometime. yes?

1139
01:16:33.300 --> 01:16:34.300
[Laughing]

1140
01:16:34.333 --> 01:16:35.767
[Scoffs]

1141
01:16:55.433 --> 01:16:57.267
[Mutters]

1142
01:16:59.400 --> 01:17:01.200
[Sighs]

1143
01:17:01.233 --> 01:17:02.733
[Kidnapper chuckles]

1144
01:17:07.367 --> 01:17:09.400
[Father groans]

1145
01:17:09.433 --> 01:17:11.600
[Man on radio]
Mendoza. do you copy?
[Gasps]

1146
01:17:11.633 --> 01:17:14.267
[Gasps]
Who's there?

1147
01:17:14.300 --> 01:17:16.333
Who else you bring?

1148
01:17:16.367 --> 01:17:17.633
[Stammers]

1149
01:17:22.233 --> 01:17:24.133
Federal agents!
Drop your weapons!

1150
01:17:26.400 --> 01:17:29.267
Drop your weapons now!

1151
01:17:29.300 --> 01:17:30.733
Now! You're
completely surrounded!

1152
01:17:36.600 --> 01:17:39.067
Ms. aveson. get down.

1153
01:17:39.100 --> 01:17:41.667
Get your people
behind me now.
Come on. Come on.

1154
01:17:41.700 --> 01:17:44.800
Come on.

1155
01:17:44.833 --> 01:17:47.300
Where are the other police?
Turn around.

1156
01:17:47.333 --> 01:17:49.600
You alone. senora?
Shut up and turn around!

1157
01:17:49.633 --> 01:17:51.267
Get down
on your knees now!

1158
01:17:51.300 --> 01:17:53.367
[Grunting]

1159
01:17:57.133 --> 01:18:00.067
I don't see nobody.

1160
01:18:00.100 --> 01:18:04.000
What happened
to your police friends?
They forget about you?

1161
01:18:05.233 --> 01:18:07.267
[Mendoza]
Turn around. now!

1162
01:18:15.300 --> 01:18:16.633
[Grunting]

1163
01:18:16.667 --> 01:18:19.167
[Grunts]

1164
01:18:19.200 --> 01:18:21.000
No! Miguelito!

1165
01:18:22.767 --> 01:18:24.800
[Grunts]
Miguelito.

1166
01:18:24.833 --> 01:18:26.667
Miguelito!

1167
01:18:33.067 --> 01:18:34.567
[Yells]

1168
01:18:34.600 --> 01:18:35.733
[Breathing heavily]

1169
01:18:39.667 --> 01:18:41.267
He's getting away!
Let him go.

1170
01:18:50.567 --> 01:18:52.133
Get outta here!
Get outta here now!

1171
01:18:53.567 --> 01:18:55.000
Go!

1172
01:18:56.133 --> 01:18:57.500
I'll get those gringos!

1173
01:18:59.200 --> 01:19:00.633
[Grunts]

1174
01:19:02.333 --> 01:19:03.400
Mom!

1175
01:19:03.433 --> 01:19:04.467
Mom!

1176
01:19:11.233 --> 01:19:12.233
[Grunts]

1177
01:19:13.467 --> 01:19:15.433
[Yells]

1178
01:19:15.467 --> 01:19:17.333
[Grunts]

1179
01:19:20.467 --> 01:19:22.567
[Groaning]

1180
01:19:45.633 --> 01:19:46.267
[Groaning]

1181
01:19:50.067 --> 01:19:51.467
Give me that.

1182
01:19:56.733 --> 01:19:59.133
So you're my
pretty little bank robber. huh?

1183
01:20:01.133 --> 01:20:03.000
I know what
my daughter did was wrong.

1184
01:20:04.667 --> 01:20:06.600
She didn't mean
to hurt anybody.

1185
01:20:08.600 --> 01:20:10.500
She doesn't deserve
to go to jail.

1186
01:20:12.100 --> 01:20:14.167
Please.

1187
01:20:14.200 --> 01:20:16.400
She's all I have left.

1188
01:20:18.800 --> 01:20:20.733
Is there something
you can do?

1189
01:20:23.633 --> 01:20:26.500
Is this
the weapon you used
in the bank robbery?

1190
01:20:29.733 --> 01:20:31.100
Well. is it. or not?

1191
01:20:33.433 --> 01:20:35.400
Who does the gun
belong to?

1192
01:20:36.767 --> 01:20:38.633
Nobody.

1193
01:20:38.667 --> 01:20:40.567
It's black market.
It can't be traced.

1194
01:20:46.100 --> 01:20:48.167
Are you prepared
to make a statement

1195
01:20:48.200 --> 01:20:50.400
that those were the three guys
that kidnapped you this morning?

1196
01:20:50.433 --> 01:20:52.500
Oh...

1197
01:20:52.533 --> 01:20:56.133
I want you to think
about what I'm asking you.
Cassie.

1198
01:21:03.233 --> 01:21:04.767
Yes.

1199
01:21:08.233 --> 01:21:10.367
Come on.
[Groans]

1200
01:21:10.400 --> 01:21:12.500
Easy.

1201
01:21:24.400 --> 01:21:26.467
Careful. Careful.

1202
01:21:32.600 --> 01:21:34.433
I still have
some contacts
in Tijuana.

1203
01:21:34.467 --> 01:21:37.067
I'm gonna say I got a tip
the robbers were here.

1204
01:21:37.100 --> 01:21:38.600
making their way
to the border.

1205
01:21:40.433 --> 01:21:42.533
What's that?

1206
01:21:42.567 --> 01:21:45.267
Look at
the surveillance video
at the bank.

1207
01:21:45.300 --> 01:21:47.133
You'll see.

1208
01:21:47.167 --> 01:21:48.767
Come on.

1209
01:21:48.800 --> 01:21:50.267
[Grunts]

1210
01:21:55.300 --> 01:21:56.467
[Sighs]

1211
01:21:56.500 --> 01:21:57.767
Thank you.

1212
01:21:57.800 --> 01:22:00.100
I never wanna
see your face again.

1213
01:22:00.133 --> 01:22:00.567
[Man on radio]
Agent mendoza. you copy?

1214
01:22:03.133 --> 01:22:06.300
Mendoza.
We're 15 minutes out.

1215
01:22:06.333 --> 01:22:08.167
I'm gonna need a 10-52.

1216
01:22:08.200 --> 01:22:10.133
Copy that.
All right.

1217
01:22:10.167 --> 01:22:12.200
The three of you
need to get out outta here.

1218
01:22:14.167 --> 01:22:17.333
You. too.
I'm staying
with my daughter.

1219
01:22:17.367 --> 01:22:21.133
If I'm gonna pin this bank job
on those three guys.
you're gonna need to leave.

1220
01:22:21.167 --> 01:22:24.433
Look. you have no idea
what I have gone through
to try and find her today.

1221
01:22:24.467 --> 01:22:26.267
and if you think
for one second...

1222
01:22:26.300 --> 01:22:28.133
Mom!

1223
01:22:28.167 --> 01:22:30.633
I'm gonna be okay.

1224
01:22:38.267 --> 01:22:39.400
[Chuckles]

1225
01:22:45.600 --> 01:22:47.100
I guess you will be.

1226
01:23:04.667 --> 01:23:07.467
Hey. can I ask you
a question?

1227
01:23:07.500 --> 01:23:09.467
Yeah.

1228
01:23:09.500 --> 01:23:11.600
If you were
in abbie's situation

1229
01:23:11.633 --> 01:23:13.133
and someone you loved
was kidnapped.

1230
01:23:13.167 --> 01:23:15.733
and you had to get ahold
of a million dollars.

1231
01:23:15.767 --> 01:23:17.733
what would you do?

1232
01:23:19.300 --> 01:23:21.200
Me?

1233
01:23:23.367 --> 01:23:25.533
I'd probably rob a bank.

1234
01:23:26.800 --> 01:23:29.400
[Chuckles]
